 "intro_zh": "巴音郭楞蒙古自治州博斯腾湖景区占地面积988平方公里，是位于我国新疆的风景名胜。景区是以博斯腾湖风景为主，博斯腾淖尔，蒙古语意为“站立”，因三道湖心山屹立于湖中而得名。博斯腾湖与雪山、湖光、绿州、沙漠、奇禽、异兽同生共荣，互相映衬，组成丰富多彩的风景画卷。",
 "intro_en": "The Bosten Lake Scenic Area in Bayingolin Mongolian Autonomous Prefecture covers an area of ​​988 square kilometers and is a scenic spot located in Xinjiang, my country. The scenic spot is dominated by the scenery of Bosten Lake. Bosten Nur, which means \"standing\" in Mongolian, is named after three mountains in the center of the lake standing in the lake. Bosten Lake co-exists with snow-capped mountains, lakes, oasis, deserts, exotic birds and exotic animals, and sets off each other to form a rich and colorful landscape.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
